Bundled third-party licences and notices
========================================

This directory is installed as /usr/share/doc/nekobox/third-party/.

  INDEX.txt           every copied file, its source path in the upstream
                      tarball and its sha256
  generated/go/       licence/notice files of the modules in
                      core/server/vendor/modules.txt, copied verbatim
  generated/cpp/      licence files shipped for bundled C/C++ components
  generated/inline/   leading copyright/licence comments of bundled files
                      that have no separate licence file, copied verbatim
  upstream/           licence texts that the upstream tarball does not ship,
                      plus PROVENANCE.txt with the project, retrieval date
                      and hash evidence

Regenerate generated/ and INDEX.txt from an extracted upstream tree with:

    scripts/collect-notices.py --source build/nekobox-<version>
    scripts/collect-notices.py --source build/nekobox-<version> --check

The collector never writes upstream/.  If a component changes, update its
entry in scripts/collect-notices.py and the evidence in
upstream/PROVENANCE.txt by hand, then regenerate.  Read debian/copyright for
the mapping from components to licences; unresolved items are listed there
instead of being guessed.  dh_compress may gzip the larger files, so refer
to directories rather than assuming an uncompressed suffix.
